            "url": "http://example.com/2024/10/31/HCM-Cloud%E4%BA%91%E7%AB%AF%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E4%BA%BA%E5%8A%9B%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0download%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/",
            "title": "HCM-Cloud云端专业人力资源平台download任意文件读取漏洞",
